# Product standard library — ooda/std

File: ooda/std/README.oot
Live walk 2026-08-16. Counts come from `find`, `git ls-files`, and
`./oodac/oodac check` on this host. RULES 1.1 / 1.7 / 1.9:
the page must match disk. Check is not emit+gcc+run.

